// form-token-census.bml — how many Form tokens the local voice writes, by kind, by store and per 1,000 IDs.
//
// Reads each store where the voice's own output lives once, under the root it is given: .hearth/code-memory/replies
// (every coding-lane reply, rated when a lane transcript names it), .hearth/native-turns/*.out (each option's lane
// transcript: its form-code counters carry the IDs the lane generated; its report line repeats a reply and is passed
// over), the drafts receipts/draft-ledger.jsonl names that lie under the root (with the IDs each row records),
// .hearth/response-sessions/generation (each generate --reasoning reply, its controls and Form's injections woven
// back in their envelope from microthought.json), and the streams and cut tails each physical row of
// receipts/form-token-eval.jsonl judged (the evaluation's own asks of the voice). The teaching corpora
// (.form-lora-voice-native/distill.jsonl, learn/form-token-traces.jsonl) are counted as taught, never as generated.
// Per kind (recipe-birth, recipe-exec, choice, eval, knowledge-query, node-get, node-make, node-select) it prints
// the controls the voice authored and their rate per 1,000 generated IDs (over the controls whose IDs were read),
// the observations Form returned (success: value, recipe, node; nothing=; other), the model kinds outside the
// eight, the Form words the voice forged (an envelope, a bare result after its own control, a runtime marker), the
// answers that cite an observation as a whole token, and the runtime markers apart. The total line comes last. One
// row lands in receipts/form-token-census.jsonl naming the absolute root it read, so growth in recipe creation,
// evaluation and node work is a reading over one root, not a claim. The reading lives in
// form-stdlib/bml/form-token-eval.bml (ftcn-*); form-stdlib/tests/form-token-census-band.bml proves it.
// stdin, optional: the root that holds the stores (default: this checkout), so a census can read the walk
// checkout where the voice writes while its row lands where the census runs:
//   print -r -- /Users/ursmuff/source/coherence-kernel-walk | ./fkwu observe/form-token-census.bml
// preflight-exec: forbidden
import form-stdlib/bml/form-token-eval.bml;
section [form.bml] {
 ftcn-run(ftcn-root());
}
